{"repositoryId":1380558103,"availability":"available","full":"solmos1900/Fantasy-Football-Optimizer","name":"Fantasy-Football-Optimizer","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-21T21:29:11Z","updated":"2026-10-16T00:56:53Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fantasyfootballoptimizer-kappa.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://fantasyfootballoptimizer-kappa.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:52.112Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:52.112Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:52.112Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:52.112Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fantasy football helper you can install like an app on your phone. Connect your ESPN fantasy league — or use Trade Analyzer / Who to Start on the full NFL player pool without a league. See projected vs actual points, and get start/sit, waiver, matchup, and trade advice with reasons you can read — not a black box.","Add it to your Home Screen on iPhone (Safari → Share → Add to Home Screen) for a full-screen shortcut.","Live: fantasyfootballoptimizer-kappa.vercel.app Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Auth.js (NextAuth v5), Prisma + PostgreSQL (Neon on Vercel)."],"features":["My Team — Your starters and bench with projected vs actual points and injury flags. Tap a row for a player detail page.","Insights — Weekly callouts: who to start or sit, free-agent pickups, news, roster gaps, and matchup notes. Trend cards show how projections compared to real scores over finished weeks.","Player detail — This week’s matchup, recent scoring, and similar players vs this defense — taken only from real finished games in your synced league. If there isn’t enough history, you get an empty state — never made-up…","Trades — Two tools on one page (work with or without a league):","Trade analyzer — With a leag